--- !u!1 &39767730
GameObject:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 39767731}
  - component: {fileID: 39767733}
  - component: {fileID: 39767732}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: 'FIELD MANUAL


    Left-click / drag: select    Shift: add selection

    Right-click:
    move, attack or gather

    F then click: attack-move soldiers

    Select barracks
    + right-click: set rally point

    Ctrl+1-9: store group    1-9: recall group

    WASD
    / arrows: camera    Wheel: zoom

    Click objects: inspect / actions    C: focus   
    Home: HQ

    Esc / right-click: cancel targeting    Esc: pause


    SUPPLY 
    Workers cost 1, soldiers cost 2. HQ and barracks

    provide some; build supply
    relays for more.


    ARMOR  Soldiers beat Light and Medium, struggle with Heavy.

    Turrets
    crush Heavy but barely scratch Light. Read the next

    wave preview and build
    the answer before it arrives.


    HOSTILES  Runners hunt your workers, brutes
    and juggernauts

    siege your structures, standard hostiles march on HQ.

    Lancers
    shoot from range, breakers are built to smash a

    defender screen, and wardens
    mend the wave until you kill

    them. Click any hostile to read what answers
    it.'
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
